I believe this fail is due to test case expects you to run it with extra option **--fw-pkg** and specify the package with firmware. 
If this option is not used, `fw_pkg_name` parametrize wont be created, and therefore on executing fixture `fw_pkg` it will fail as for it takes `fw_pkg_name` as argument - [conftest](https://github.com/sonic-net/sonic-mgmt/blob/4727e54a8da8aa56006224323327909aef7fed2d/tests/platform_tests/fwutil/conftest.py#L23)

```
def pytest_generate_tests(metafunc):
    val = metafunc.config.getoption('--fw-pkg')
    if 'fw_pkg_name' in metafunc.fixturenames and val is not None:
        metafunc.parametrize('fw_pkg_name', [val], scope="module")

@pytest.fixture(scope='module')
def fw_pkg(fw_pkg_name):
```
